YHA II-III级、在GDMT基础上仍有症状的慢性HFrEF成人受试者","quote_sha256":"df9c7936dd69ef4c5f0247f18fa0d36e82e905494d2d4afcadbcd1b51bac2bcb","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","span_id":"span_def_population"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:revision:4","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄18-75周岁；慢性心力衰竭伴LVEF≤40%、NYHA II-III级；筛选前稳定剂量GDMT至少4周","quote_sha256":"ed817a4709749259b60d2fb2c8fc840f323dd29db98f95c352f1d56826ac2c8d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","span_id":"span_def_inclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:revision:4","quote":"排除标准模块：筛选前6个月内急性心肌梗死、不稳定型心衰或卒中；收缩压<90mmHg；eGFR<30mL/min/1.73m²；妊娠或哺乳期；30天内使用过其他sGC激动剂或PDE5抑制剂","quote_sha256":"00eedca3c214010b6188381ed829bba469eed145f0d64272cdc2c8a954db024e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","span_id":"span_def_exclusion"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:revision:4","quote":"目标研究人群：年龄段：成人；疾病状态：中重度；在标准心衰治疗（GDMT）基础上仍残留症状的成人HFrEF患者","quote_sha256":"eee2450d9723c5490db6c5a3ab42a40e674f6084a2ff533c46eb680d7202c128","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","span_id":"span_def_target_pop"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["span_pkg_5","span_def_population","span_def_inclusion","span_def_exclusion","span_def_target_pop"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充筛选期评估项目、筛选失败处理和重新筛选流程后完善相关内容","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_5_screening","missing_source_classes":["筛选期评估项目清单","筛选失败与重新筛选流程文件","知情同意与入组程序文件"],"target":"5 研究人群"}],"heading":"研究人群","missing_source_classes":["筛选期评估项目清单","筛选失败与重新筛选流程文件","知情同意与入组程序文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究计划纳入年龄18-75周岁、慢性心力衰竭伴左心室射血分数（LVEF）≤40%、纽约心脏协会（NYHA）II-III级、在标准心衰治疗（GDMT）基础上仍有症状的成人HFrEF受试者。入组受试者应在筛选前至少4周接受稳定剂量的GDMT。筛选时须同时满足上述入选标准，且不存在以下排除情形：筛选前6个月内发生急性心肌梗死、不稳定型心衰或卒中；收缩压<90mmHg；eGFR<30mL/min/1.73m²；妊娠或哺乳期；30天内使用过其他sGC激动剂或PDE5抑制剂。研究人群为在GDMT基础上仍残留症状的中重度慢性HFrEF成人，计划在多中心开展。","rationale":"已确认研究事实支持目标人群、年龄范围、LVEF、NYHA分级、GDMT稳定时间以及各项排除标准；医学作者需核对筛选期评估项目、筛选失败处理、重新筛选流程及知情同意与入组程序文件是否齐备。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究人群）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_fe1c497771c5_745def270ebd8abd","section_number":"5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:fa610c8091cdd1d9b16e8544","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"b11d93f8677361cde00c4352d7f78f988a96f528b40bded94c26ae29af429ad6","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_fe1c497771c5_9d1504b5410e545a:full-draft:fa610c8091cdd1d9b16e8544","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:fa610c8091cdd1d9b16e8544","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:b2fad76b695bf897b4e04ce3505081473b5300c0c367ca70655b286de53d9ad1:fa610c8091cdd1d9b16e8544","text_sha256":"b11d93f8677361cde00c4352d7f78f988a96f528b40bded94c26ae29af429ad6"},{"content_sha256":"cdd5a150f7cda98ee48b97371d97169298a9052ee8304fb7640781c76b58e16e","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_2de134b50e0bce848347:r4:5f6c0d0d89036c7e","text_sha256":"cdd5a150f7cda98ee48b97371d97169298a9052ee8304fb7640781c76b58e16e"}]}